output:
=== Enable CDC ===
POST /tables
request: {"cdc_retention": 2, "name": "demo_current"}
status: 201
response: {"cdc_retention": 2, "table": "demo_current"}

=== Initial cursor ===
GET /tables/demo_current/changes?after_seq=0&limit=10
status: 200
response: {"changes": [], "latest_seq": 0, "table": "demo_current"}

=== Upsert sku-1=red ===
POST /tables/demo_current/rows
request: {"key": "sku-1", "label": "red"}
status: 200
response: {"changed": true, "key": "sku-1", "label": "red", "table": "demo_current"}

=== Upsert sku-2=blue ===
POST /tables/demo_current/rows
request: {"key": "sku-2", "label": "blue"}
status: 200
response: {"changed": true, "key": "sku-2", "label": "blue", "table": "demo_current"}

=== Upsert sku-1=green ===
POST /tables/demo_current/rows
request: {"key": "sku-1", "label": "green"}
status: 200
response: {"changed": true, "key": "sku-1", "label": "green", "table": "demo_current"}

=== Equal retry consumes no sequence ===
POST /tables/demo_current/rows
request: {"key": "sku-1", "label": "green"}
status: 200
response: {"changed": false, "key": "sku-1", "label": "green", "table": "demo_current"}

=== Retained changes ===
GET /tables/demo_current/changes?after_seq=1&limit=10
status: 200
response: {"changes": [{"key": "sku-2", "kind": "upsert", "label": "blue", "seq": 2}, {"key": "sku-1", "kind": "upsert", "label": "green", "seq": 3}], "latest_seq": 3, "table": "demo_current"}

=== Expired cursor ===
GET /tables/demo_current/changes?after_seq=0&limit=10
status: 410
response: {"error": {"code": "cdc_cursor_expired", "message": "cursor is behind the retained records: 0"}}

=== Validation precedes table lookup ===
GET /tables/no-such-table/changes?after_seq=-1&limit=10
status: 422
response: {"error": {"code": "invalid_request", "message": "invalid value for query parameter: after_seq"}}

=== Enable versioned CDC ===
POST /tables
request: {"cdc_retention": 3, "event_time_versioned": true, "name": "demo_versioned"}
status: 201
response: {"cdc_retention": 3, "event_time_versioned": true, "table": "demo_versioned"}

=== Add version point ===
POST /tables/demo_versioned/rows
request: {"effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "label": "old"}
status: 200
response: {"changed": true, "effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "label": "old", "table": "demo_versioned"}

=== Reject conflicting version point ===
POST /tables/demo_versioned/rows
request: {"effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "label": "conflict"}
status: 409
response: {"error": {"code": "dimension_version_conflict", "message": "version ('sku-9', 100) already exists with a different label"}}

=== Conflict leaves CDC unchanged ===
GET /tables/demo_versioned/changes?after_seq=0&limit=10
status: 200
response: {"changes": [{"effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "kind": "upsert", "label": "old", "seq": 1}], "latest_seq": 1, "table": "demo_versioned"}

=== Version 7 snapshot ===
GET /snapshot
status: 200
response: {"format_version": 7, "streams": [], "tables": [{"cdc_changes": [{"key": "sku-2", "kind": "upsert", "label": "blue", "seq": 2}, {"key": "sku-1", "kind": "upsert", "label": "green", "seq": 3}], "cdc_retention": 2, "latest_cdc_seq": 3, "name": "demo_current", "rows": [{"key": "sku-1", "label": "green"}, {"key": "sku-2", "label": "blue"}]}, {"cdc_changes": [{"effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "kind": "upsert", "label": "old", "seq": 1}], "cdc_retention": 3, "event_time_versioned": true, "latest_cdc_seq": 1, "name": "demo_versioned", "versions": [{"effective_from_ms": 100, "key": "sku-9", "label": "old"}]}]}

PASS demonstrated CDC retention, cursor validation, conflict atomicity, and snapshot version 7
